  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "建築視域下的海洋城市探索",
    "sub_ename": "EXPLORATION OF MARINE URBANISM IN AN ARCHITECTURAL CONTEXT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程結合英國AA建築聯盟學院（Architectural Association）Visiting School，的模式，聚焦「海洋都市」的建築與設計議題。透過理論探討、實地參訪與跨領域創作，培養學生因應海洋與都市環境之整合思維，並完成具創新與實踐意義的作品展示。",
    "describe_eh": "This course, in collaboration with the AA (Architectural Association) Visiting School model, centers on architectural and design issues of “Marine Urbanism.” Through theoretical exploration, field visits, and cross-disciplinary creation, students develop integrated thinking for marine and urban environments, ultimately presenting innovative and practice-oriented design outcomes.",
